cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this project or its data, please cite it as below.
title: 'Global Heshmat: Following the Egyptian Sculptor Hassan Heshmat Around the World'
abstract: >-
  An interactive cartographic web application tracing the public artworks of the
  Egyptian sculptor Hassan Heshmat (1920-2006) across Egypt, Europe, and beyond,
  together with the places where he lived and worked. Source code is MIT
  licensed; editorial content is CC BY 4.0; photographs remain the property of
  their respective rights-holders.
type: software
